    {
      "id": 71738,
      "name": "Envisioner",
      "username": "Envisioner",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-18T07:33:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only way I can see this being fixed is if they take the text about chaining Fowl off of the Fowl cards and put it on both sides of The Matriarch (which I assume was not previously done for space reasons, though they could just use a smaller typeface a la The Dreamer).&nbsp; As long as the ability comes from the card, there's no way per the rules that we have to ensure that the ability always works - whether it's card order (the Fowl is the latest card played) or player choice (\"what, you call this difficulty 4?\"), there's no way the birds will come out in large quantities against SST or HTR unless very specific rules to that effect are provided.</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:50:59.690Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
