      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The only way I can see this being fixed is if they take the text about chaining Fowl off of the Fowl cards and put it on both sides of The Matriarch (which I assume was not previously done for space reasons, though they could just use a smaller typeface a la The Dreamer).&nbsp; As long as the ability comes from the card, there&#39;s no way per the rules that we have to ensure that the ability always works - whether it&#39;s card order (the Fowl is the latest card played) or player choice (&quot;what, you call this difficulty 4?&quot;), there&#39;s no way the birds will come out in large quantities against SST or HTR unless very specific rules to that effect are provided.</p>",
