      "username": "brytehfryguy",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/f0a364/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-18T14:08:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Currently, Hair-Trigger Reflexes has errata that makes it so she does not shut down Matriarch. Surprize Shopping Trip does shut her down, but it does not stay in play for the rest of the game unlike Hair-Trigger tends to.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There are plenty of enviroments that can shut down a villian for a turn, so having one that stops the birds from chaining for one round is not nearly as big a problem as having ExPat play one of her cards and trivializing the remainder of the game.</p>",
